    {
      "record_id": "T-LVL",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：先给关系写出“谁—怎样—什么”",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.analogy.relation_level"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-LVL"
      ],
      "independence_group": "analogy-level-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "release_ready",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-LVL"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "把词组改写成一句带位置的关系：例如“鸟卵经过孵化”。选项若只给出最终对象、地点或部件，就没有保留原关系中的过程层级。先判断每个词在关系中扮演什么位置，再比较选项。",
      "record_sha256": "52e01513f43d64afe6feb0c061840a165d1b3d3940e91497dda9c7c3ae6f6236"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-DIR",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：关系动词不能倒过来读",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.analogy.relation_direction"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-DIR"
      ],
      "independence_group": "analogy-direction-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "release_ready",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-DIR"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "先完整说出箭头方向，再套到选项上。题干是“事物经过某过程”，不是“结果做某个动作”。只要把动作放到结果一侧或把前后词互换，即使都属于同一领域，也不是同一种关系。",
      "record_sha256": "213d803d9ef9ae3cae6834bcc93f62116cb21a1cfacf3936e6dc04203bd4165f"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-SURF",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：同一场景不等于同一关系",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.judgment.analogy.relation_evidence"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-SURF"
      ],
      "independence_group": "analogy-surface-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "release_ready",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-SURF"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "先遮住词的领域含义，只比较关系句能否替换。巢穴和鸟卵同属鸟类场景，但“鸟卵在巢穴中”不是“鸟卵经过孵化”。优先选择能复述同一关系动词和方向的选项。",
      "record_sha256": "384d342083b1d39214bcffead036d65a9d871b066bbcb1d5e8717cc02696357f"
    },
